{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_st04",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_st04",
  "title": "未知与未来",
  "storyCode": "NL-ST-4",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "cdf829e55efeecd527aecf377f31dd217fcfeec307207569ea3e67634d12505a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视里的声音",
      "text": "特锦赛出现特殊情况——两位冠军共赴冠军墙，这是前所未有的事情！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视里的声音",
      "text": "不仅如此，冠军耀骑士——拒绝了来自骑士协会的颁奖，独自离开！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电视里的声音",
      "text": "这毫无疑问是一种亵渎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "疼疼疼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "老家伙，不能打就不要强出头，交给玛莉娅和佐菲娅不就好了吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老骑士",
      "text": "你有脸说我！？啊——疼疼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "干嘛老盯着你那把锤子，马丁，一晚上的热身运动，让你怀念起过去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "......有点吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光头马丁",
      "text": "也不知道临光家那边怎么样了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛莉娅",
      "text": "......叔叔......要暂时离开大骑士领？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "你们到底是姓临光的，别总是待在佐菲娅家里，不成体统。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......我会离开一段时间，在这期间......玛嘉烈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......你真的决定留在卡西米尔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......你应该知道自己会面对什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "你不会被理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......当然，我一开始就知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "那就这样吧，我们没有其他话可说了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "......怎么突然改性了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......托兰......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "突然想要离开大骑士领，哼？为了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......在你眼里，我现在是什么模样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "能什么模样。你自己还不清楚吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "——但是说真的，你让我们所有人都失望了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "你可以不是监正会的高层，可以不是改变国民院的那个人，但是，你至少该是我们的英雄，我们的临光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "我不知道你离开城市是要去哪儿，但我得说——除了我以外，他们大都失望了。再让他们见到你，他们会巴不得杀了你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "那他们打得过我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "啧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "我放弃了很多东西，托兰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......只是，我还是经常怀抱着一个不切实际的想法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "他们应该还在某处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "他是战争英雄的长子，他是我玛恩纳的兄弟，是家族最强大的骑士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "而她......是卡西米尔最美的人，优雅，端庄，如同一颗宝石......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "他们曾是我眼中的天之骄子，他们不该就这么......了无音讯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "十多年了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "我一直在想这件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "已经十五年了。当时花了那么久苦寻无果，现在又想——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......只是......带薪旅行而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "你一个人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "一趟未必有希望的旅程，一个人还不够吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "你不是一个会......被耀骑士带来的情绪感染的人，我就先不问你为什么突然作出决定了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托兰",
      "text": "你知道怎么找到我......“我们”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛恩纳",
      "text": "......我要找到的，是我自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "......罗德岛吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "那里能为你们提供治疗，而且，也不会强迫你们做些什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "既然是耀骑士一直以来效力的组织......那么，也可信吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "他们的理想将会照亮整片大地，哪怕现在，我也这么相信着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "你还会回到那里吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......迟早有一天，会的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "那那时候能和我比划比划吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查丝汀娜",
      "text": "......艾、艾沃娜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "text": "干嘛，想挑战冠军不是人之常情吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "那算我一个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾纳蒂",
      "text": "传奇的骑士家族......很令人好奇不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......一言为定，到时我一定奉陪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "啊哈哈，这些家伙松了口气之后就容易兴奋起来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "你早就意识到自己不是感染者了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "text": "但你仍旧愿意为感染者而战？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "只是为那些饱受苦难的人们而战。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "......董事会很生气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "看来，我们得少几个月奖金了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......奖金。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "我们把那么多感染者，骑士，甚至是无胄盟的性命都卷入其中，影响的，居然只是奖金？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "......关于这件事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "跟我来，马克维茨兄。我们也该讨论你的去留了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "......你先前关于电话的一席言论，我事后想了想，确实有道理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "我们在等谁的电话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "......一位记者的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......呃......记者？我们需要接受记者采访吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "许多人都这么称呼他。只是个称呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......等等......记者......难道是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "麦基吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "......是。向你介绍一下，现在，在电话那头的，是玫瑰新闻联合报业的董事长......“记者”凯恩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "马克维茨也在旁边。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "是，很荣幸与您通讯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "马克维茨是我花重金从梅什科工业手里拿下的，他会是我的左膀右臂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "所以这里没有外人，麦基，你可以喊我父亲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "......好的，父亲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "嗯，你的母亲还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "很好，父亲。常常念起你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "你呢？你结婚了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "......我......暂时还没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "您呢？父亲？您现在......在哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "......哥伦比亚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人麦基",
      "text": "......您什么时候回到卡西米尔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "呵呵......还没到时候，麦基。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "那些目光短浅的人看不出，但哥伦比亚才是真正威胁到卡西米尔的敌人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "我们的报纸还没能覆盖他们的城市，我们的声音还传达不到哥伦比亚人的耳旁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "他们发展的速度令人惊恐，我们必须遏制......抢占他们的市场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "国与国博弈是这么的迷人，麦基。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "但那些......贵族。呸。固步自封......维多利亚，乌萨斯，这些强大的国家却又愚昧到令人心疼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "马克维茨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "你愿意为商业联合会奉献一切吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "你是个能人，只从那些只言片语的报告中，我就能感觉到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "难道，你还对那些骑士......心怀悲悯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "看来我说中了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "孩子，请你思考一个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "当卡西米尔高速军舰的数量远超乌萨斯，当哥伦比亚充斥着卡西米尔的商队与商品，当边境要塞的数量比现在翻上一番——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "战争还存在吗？乌萨斯还是个威胁吗？卡西米尔还会软弱吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "当然，不会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "骑士们才是卡西米尔的蛀虫。愚昧的贵族，荣耀......呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "我听说了特锦赛发生的事情，监正会难道以为，他们“挣足了面子”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "荣耀和面子，要多少就给他们多少吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "时间和人民站在我们这边，只消几场比赛，民众就会忘记耀骑士带来的冲击，而投入下一轮消费与娱乐中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "对他们而言，“争论哪一位骑士更强”“争论骑士周边的定价是否合理”，比关注我们留下的所有糟粕都要重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "国家站在我们这边。卡西米尔已经离不开商业联合会提供的经济基础。那些可悲的征战骑士......有多少已经主动向我们臣服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "马克维茨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "这一次，你有选择的权利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......在我回答之前，我可以先问一个问题吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "说吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......恰尔内先生......仅仅是因为没能成功阻止耀骑士闯入比赛，就遭到了流放......以我的标准来看，这不合理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "为什么......恰尔内，啊，你命运的转折点，马克维茨。我也得谢谢他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "不过，如果我告诉你，恰尔内的消失——和耀骑士没有直接的关系呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "如果我告诉你，他的流放，仅仅是因为一系列古旧的权力争斗，被找了个恰到好处的借口就流放了呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "——恰尔内是因为几年前的一场贿赂东窗事发，被政敌借机流放的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "和耀骑士一点关系也没有......和你的命运一点交集也没有。往往这才是事情的真相，现代的真相就是至高无上的冷漠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "发言人马克维茨",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "马克维茨，来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "电话那头的声音",
      "text": "我们将成为大地的喉舌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......哈？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "怎么了，不喜欢我们的新店面吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "店面......你们......开了家店？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......你瞎吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "不......可是......卖洗手液的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "“源石云”日用品可是这几年最受欢迎的品牌——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "——而推出“源石云”日用品品牌的公司呢，有“三个老板”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "很快，那三位老板，就会成为商业联合会的一员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......你们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "......是的，只是为了能加入他们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "你知道的内幕越多，你就越会察觉到未来的方向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "雇佣兵和杀手迟早会过时的，因为他们不需要这么多，而说到底，杀手不过取人命而已......而他们，能豪取他国。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "这也是时代的选择，白金。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "对了，来给咱们当前台小妹吧，正好缺个服务员。你的模样也挺标致的，应该没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "text": "......啧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "我们会在近期安排一次无胄盟任务，让我们三个全都人间蒸发，然后找到最好的整容医师，改头换面，成为兢兢业业的销售员。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "所以......你们借感染者造成大停电的时候......做掉了董事会与无胄盟直接对接的每一个人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "......能这么简单，也是多亏了他们自己啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "董事会内部可有太多的明争暗斗了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "谁能调配无胄盟，谁就具有压倒性的优势——哪个董事都不敢明目张胆操纵无胄盟，也不敢让别人这么做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "也正因如此，他们的互相掣肘让他们对无胄盟失去了控制力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "哈哈，讲个笑话，卡西米尔人已经不知道自己雇佣的杀手组织头子姓甚名谁，身在何方了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......玄铁大位......是真实存在的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "......谁知道呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "也许玄铁只有一人，也许是两人。也许玄铁只是个幌子，也许玄铁，是指我们两个青金共同行动的暗号。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "但也有可能，玄铁今天早上在街上与你擦肩而过，此时正坐在董事会开会，或者在萨米的别墅里休假。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "没有人知道。所以他们才值得恐惧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "......最后一点，无论如何，你本来是该死的，作为替罪者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗伊",
      "text": "我们会盯着你的，你也是个无胄盟，你不会想和我们为敌的，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "（得......逃走......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "......博士，阿米娅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "啊......临光小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
      "text": "特地叫你们来，是为了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "道别的话就别说了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我们会再见的，对吧？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "text": "啊......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "text": "......嗯。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "text": "如果罗德岛呼唤我，那么我一定会前往您的身边，博士，阿米娅。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......嗯！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "text": "......我已经在外流浪许多年了，直到现在，我才有时间......回望我的家乡。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "text": "也许，我该去祖父的坟上祭拜......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "text": "临光。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "啊......博士，我们先走一步吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "临光小姐！保重！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "后会有期。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "保重。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我们很快就会再见的。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "text": "......嗯，保重。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "text": "该说再见了，临光。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "text": "......闪灵。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "text": "我其实......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "text": "不，我知道你要说什么。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "text": "伦蒂尼姆，我们亲自去。一如你回到这里。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "text": "那些罪孽......那些过去，我们亲自去斩断。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "text": "......闪灵？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "text": "丽兹......也许真到某个时刻，你会痛恨我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "text": "但是，相信我，我永远会在你的身旁。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "夜莺",
          "text": "我......我怎么会痛恨你呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "闪灵",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "text": "如果到那时，你需要我的话——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "text": "我向你们起誓——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "玛嘉烈",
          "text": "——耀骑士玛嘉烈·临光，将为你们而战。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "三天后，大骑士领外，某村庄"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "text": "......就是这里？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "是个很不错的镇子吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "text": "你们总是待在这样的地方吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "起初，我待的地方确实就和贼窝差不多，就算眼线遍布了周遭的各个城市，也顶多在黑市和地下活动。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "不过之后......我遇到了一些人。他们改变了我的想法。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "挑重点说吧，再之后，我们和锈锤打了一仗。知道锈锤吗？一群疯子......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "很多人都误以为锈锤只是一群劫匪，其实不然，那一仗里，我甚至看到了十几岁的孩子，拿着铁管。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "是不是挺疯的？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "text": "喔......挺可怕的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "......这才是他们可怕的地方。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "锈锤不是为了对抗文明而诞生的。锈锤正是因为文明的发展而诞生的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "别指望他们真的有什么出路，有什么目的，把他们当作一个理性的群体来看本来就是错误的——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "他们只是文明的遗孤。当文明发展却又照顾不到所有人的时候，他们就诞生了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "无家可归，无路可去，在源石遍地的贫瘠荒野生存。他们就是天灾。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "托他们的福，我们团结在了一起，然后，也让我们意识到了一些事情......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "我们可不想变成那种疯子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "text": "......所以呢？我们要做什么？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "我想让你见见几个人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "text": "什么人？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "几个感染者。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "text": "感染者？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "几个农民，几个骑士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "text": "大杂烩喔。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "几个工人，几个赏金猎人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "几个活不下去的村长，几个筋疲力尽的贵族。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "几个大学生，几个文盲。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "几个试图改变卡西米尔的人。几个被卡西米尔改变了的人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "别这么吃惊，该吃惊的事情才刚刚开始。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "索娜，你问过我，挫败商业联合会有什么意义，骑士有什么意义。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "我倒是想反问你一个问题，在商人崛起，卡西米尔被商业联合会死死攥在手里之前——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "——是谁在剥削穷人，欺压百姓？是谁吊死感染者，躲藏在权力筑起的高楼之中？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "是骑士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "索娜",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "从来没有新的邪恶崛起，我们就要扶持上一个反派的道理，何必呢，倒霉的总是自己。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "不过说实话，尽管商业联合会几个字处处透露着丑恶的气息......但难得还是有可取之处的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "被城市忽视的人们，应当联合起来。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "憔悴的少女",
          "text": "......托兰，这就是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "大骑士领的感染者骑士，我们已经达成了合作关系。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "其他人都在吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "憔悴的少女",
          "text": "都在，都在里面......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "好，你也进来吧，可萝尔......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "托兰",
          "text": "天已经亮了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
